CapCut Video Editing Guide

A beginner-friendly resource for learning video editing workflows, improving creative projects, and creating engaging content for social media.

About This Project
This repository shares general educational information about desktop video editing, including editing techniques, project organization, transitions, effects, audio, and export settings.

What You'll Learn

- Organizing video clips and project files
- Trimming and arranging footage
- Adding transitions, titles, and visual effects
- Working with background music and audio
- Choosing export settings for different platforms
- Improving your video editing workflow

Recommended Resource
Explore the [CapCut Desktop Video Editor](https://www.capcut.com/tools/desktop-video-editor) to learn more about available editing features and tools.

Who Is This For?

- Beginners learning video editing
- Social media content creators
- Travel vloggers
- Students creating video projects
- Anyone interested in improving their editing workflow

